- girlStandUi: tool icons grown 2 pt (sides/top) / 4 pt (bottom) for selection ring + count badge; hint toast band
  (36 pt on layout.toast, full width in portrait) as a keep-out
- MEADOW_STAND_LOCAL: short line from player_spawn up-left (3-5 m); per-screen stop by regionGirlStand
- girlStandStop: whole line behind the camera (meadow landscape preview) returns a non-clear stop instead of throwing
- girl-frame / region-landing-hook: 8 screens (+320x568, 768x1024, 1024x768), GGbot's toolbar rects + hint line as an
  independent fixture; swap/landing checks on 7 portrait screens

OPEN (lead decision): 08→09 O5 is +4.40 s over Build05 (limit 3 s; r4 base +2.64 s) and F7b 0.5° left of behind at d=6.4;
every clear corner stop costs >3 s (best +3.24 s). 95d3eee keeps O5/F7b but its 390x844/414x896 stop overlaps the hint line.
